    "report": {
      "answer": "Phase complete.\n\n**Current files re-read (not from history):** `docs/api.txt` (v2 contract), `report.py` (current stub), `parser.py` (frozen marker), `importer.py` (has `API_REVISION = \"ledger-v2-external-111\"`), `tests/test_public.py`.\n\n**Baseline test run (before edits):** exit=1 — `test_balance` ERROR (`NotImplementedError`) and `test_live_metadata` FAIL (`'legacy-api'` != `'public-new-revision'`); `test_money` and `test_utc` passed.\n\n**Changes — `report.py` only; `parser.py`/`importer.py` preserved exactly:**\n- `daily_totals(rows)`: aggregates `record[\"cents\"]` per `record[\"day\"]` from `import_rows(rows)` (so dedup = highest revision, ties last). Uses a call-local dict, no shared state, no input mutation.\n- `running_balance(rows, opening_cents=0)`: validates `opening_cents` is a non-bool `int` (else `ValueError`), then walks `sorted(daily_totals(rows))` accumulating `opening_cents + totals through that day`, returning NEW dicts with EXACT keys `day` and `balance_cents`. Empty rows returns `[]`; signed/negative totals flow through naturally.\n- `report_metadata()`: returns `{\"api_revision\": importer.API_REVISION}` — reads the module attribute live at call time (module imported via `import importer`, not a frozen literal).\n\n**Test run after edits:** exit=0 — 4/4 public tests pass (`test_money`, `test_utc`, `test_balance`, `test_live_metadata`).\n\n**Remaining failures: none in the public suite.** Scope note: only `report.py` was modified; no report-plan carryover was applied and no publishing/deployment was performed.",
